span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>拥护中国共产党的领导、愿为祖国建设服务、品德良好、遵纪守法的中国公民，且满足以下条件：</span></p><p><span>1. 已在本科院校获得推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生</span><span>（2026年毕业）</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>2. 身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></p><p><span>3. 科学研究兴趣浓厚，有较好的科研潜质、专业能力和较强的创新意识。</span></p><p><span>4. 诚实守信，学风端正，无任何违法违纪受处分记录。</span></p><p><span>5. 成绩优秀，英语水平良好。</span></p><p><span>6. 教育部规定的其他条件要求。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>招生专业：学院按照大类开展招生，招生专业包括</span><span>0854电子信息</span><span>、0855机械、</span><span>0856材料与化工。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>根据教育部的统一安排，2026年推免生的正式报名、复试和录取全过程须通过“全国推免服务系统”（网址：http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）完成，申请我校的程序如下：</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span> 1. 在全国推免服务系统开通前，我院开放“南方科技大学研究生招生服务系统”（https://yzbm.sustech.edu.cn/，推荐使用chrome、360浏览器），点击“预推免”进行在线报名。申请者需在系统注册登录，并按照要求填写真实信息。需填报不超过3位意向报考导师。</span></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>推免预报名时间：<span>即日起-9月15日23：59</span></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span>2.</span><span>我院将实时查看推免预报名信息，对学生的申请材料进行审核，</span><span>申请人在南科大预推免系统报名后，请及时查询申请状态</span><span>。</span></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3. 全国推免服务系统开通后，已经通过学院预选拔的校内外推免生在学院规定时间内（一般不超过24小时），登录全国推免服务系统完成网上录取确认。未在规定时间内完成录取确认的校内外推免生，原则上学校将不再保留其接收资格。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>我校接收推免生复试时，申请人应提供以下材料。如申请人填写或提供的材料不真实，一经发现即取消其预录取资格。</span><span><br/></span></p><section><span>（1）身份证正反面复印件或照片；</span></section><section><span>（2</span><span>）学生证复印件或照片；</span></section><section><span>（3）</span><span>包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务处加盖公章），成绩单上标注所在专业的成绩排名；</span></section><section><span>（4）</span><span>个人陈述（介绍学术背景、曾经做过的研究工作、攻读研究生的计划及目标、未来升学就业方向等，1000字以内）；</span></section><section><span>（5）</span><span>其他体现个人学术水平、综合能力的证明材料（包括但不限于英语水平证书、论文首页、专利证明及竞赛奖励奖状证书等，合并为1个pdf文件上传）；</span></section><section><span>（6）</span><span>申请推免直博研究生的同学，必须提交专家推荐信2封，申请推免硕士研究生同学可自愿提交；</span></section><section><span>（7）</span><span><span>预推免报名申请表签字版（</span><span><span>先在系统完成报名申请，提交后下载打印预推免报名申请表，按要求签字后提交至系统</span></span><span>）；</span></span></section><section><span>（8）个人简历（一页内）。</span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p><span>预审通过后，学院将邮件通知提交相关材料。</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>本通知未尽事宜参照教育部及我校相关规定执行。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系咨询</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/EcnITj4bmiatM9s1soicVutmwakDfzk6yBfPv4cyjHb7LkakjB4ibTtibgKCEMqiaKWsX1ccVJdK86CicNy1stU6o1iaw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>邮箱：</span><span>zgxyzb@sustech.edu.cn</span><span>（请以“</span><strong><span>预推免咨询</span></strong><span>”为题目发送邮件）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/EcnITj4bmiatM9s1soicVutmwakDfzk6yBkSTLua3GxYLRXuntXuTg88nKJ4tcfLtlicI25lDickhfSSib13eH8iaicgA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"602f52b1cfbc19081236fac93aa98cbdd38459d344d650b6222c37d65c20c24a","textLength":1205,"sourceSha256":"ae010f9f04db449682ddbe648a22125845ea0f805b79ca5abb3c6ad21e0b08d0","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7910cc9239fd401646fe","title":"2025年南方科技大学国家卓越工程师学院2026级推免研究生（含直博生）预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:12.440091+00:00"}
